activity Draft Contract
activity Review Contract
activity Negotiate Terms
activity Approve Contract
activity Sign Contract
activity Archive Contract
bind Draft Contract: Contract ID, Contract Value
bind Review Contract: Review Outcome
bind Approve Contract: Approval Status
bind Sign Contract: Signature Status
Contract ID: integer between 1000 and 9999
Contract Value: float between 10000.0 and 1000000.0
Approval Status: Pending, Approved, Rejected
Signature Status: Unsigned, Partially Signed, Fully Signed
Review Outcome: Accepted, Requires Changes, Rejected
Init[Draft Contract] | |
End[Archive Contract] | |
Existence[Review Contract] | |
Absence4[Negotiate Terms] | |
Exactly[Sign Contract] | |
Responded Existence[Negotiate Terms, Review Contract] | | |
Precedence[Review Contract, Approve Contract] |A.Review Outcome is Accepted | |
Precedence[Approve Contract, Sign Contract] |A.Approval Status is Approved | |
Response[Draft Contract, Review Contract] | | |
Response[Review Contract, Negotiate Terms] |A.Review Outcome is Requires Changes | |
Succession[Approve Contract, Sign Contract] |A.Approval Status is Approved | |
Alternate Response[Draft Contract, Review Contract] | | |
Alternate Succession[Approve Contract, Sign Contract] | | |
Chain Response[Approve Contract, Sign Contract] |A.Approval Status is Approved | |
Chain Succession[Approve Contract, Sign Contract] |A.Approval Status is Approved | |
Co-Existence[Negotiate Terms, Review Contract] | | |
Choice[Negotiate Terms, Approve Contract] | | |
Exclusive Choice[Review Contract, Review Contract] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Sign Contract, Negotiate Terms] |A.Signature Status is Fully Signed | |
Not Responded Existence[Archive Contract, Negotiate Terms] | | |
Not Precedence[Sign Contract, Archive Contract] | | |
Not Response[Archive Contract, Draft Contract] | |A.Contract ID == T.Contract ID |
Not Succession[Sign Contract, Draft Contract] | | |
Not Chain Precedence[Draft Contract, Archive Contract] | | |
Not Chain Response[Review Contract, Sign Contract] |A.Review Outcome is Rejected | |
Not Chain Succession[Negotiate Terms, Archive Contract] | | |